sole with echo."},"sortText":"2getche"},{"label":"getenv","kind":3,"detail":"getenv(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Return contents of environment variable s."},"sortText":"2getenv"},{"label":"iand","kind":3,"detail":"iand(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Bitwise AND of i and j."},"sortText":"2iand"},{"label":"icom","kind":3,"detail":"icom(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce bitwise complement (one's complement) of i."},"sortText":"2icom"},{"label":"image","kind":3,"detail":"image(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Return string image of object x."},"sortText":"2image"},{"label":"insert","kind":3,"detail":"insert(x1,x2,x3)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Insert element x2 into set or table x1 if not already there if x1 is a table, the assigned value for element x2 is x3. (always succeeds and returns x1)."},"sortText":"2insert"},{"label":"integer","kind":3,"detail":"integer(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to an integer, failing if that is not possible."},"sortText":"2integer"},{"label":"ior","kind":3,"detail":"ior(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Bitwise inclusive OR of i and j."},"sortText":"2ior"},{"label":"ishift","kind":3,"detail":"ishift(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce i shifted j bit positions (left if j\u003c0, right if j\u003e0)."},"sortText":"2ishift"},{"label":"ixor","kind":3,"detail":"ixor(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Bitwise exclusive OR of i and j."},"sortText":"2ixor"},{"label":"kbhit","kind":3,"detail":"kbhit()","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Check to see if there is a keyboard character waiting to be read."},"sortText":"2kbhit"},{"label":"key","kind":3,"detail":"key(T)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Generate successive keys (entry values) from table T."},"sortText":"2key"},{"label":"left","kind":3,"detail":"left(s1,i,s2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","v