ributes given in trailing arguments."},"sortText":"2open"},{"label":"ord","kind":3,"detail":"ord(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce integer ordinal (value) of single character."},"sortText":"2ord"},{"label":"pop","kind":3,"detail":"pop(L)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Remove and produce an element from the left end of list L (as get)."},"sortText":"2pop"},{"label":"pos","kind":3,"detail":"pos(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Test if \u0026pos is at position i in \u0026subject."},"sortText":"2pos"},{"label":"proc","kind":3,"detail":"proc(x,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a procedure if possible; use i to resolve ambiguous string names."},"sortText":"2proc"},{"label":"pull","kind":3,"detail":"pull(L)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Pull an element from end of list L."},"sortText":"2pull"},{"label":"push","kind":3,"detail":"push(L,x1,...,xN)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Push x onto beginning of list L."},"sortText":"2push"},{"label":"put","kind":3,"detail":"put(L,x1,...,xN)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Put elements onto end of list L."},"sortText":"2put"},{"label":"read","kind":3,"detail":"read(f)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Read line on file f."},"sortText":"2read"},{"label":"reads","kind":3,"detail":"reads(f,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Read i bytes on file f."},"sortText":"2reads"},{"label":"real","kind":3,"detail":"real(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a real number, failing if that is not possible."},"sortText":"2real"},{"label":"remove","kind":3,"detail":"remove(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Remove the file named s."},"sortText":"2remove"},{"label":"rename","kind":3,"detail":"rename(s1,s2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Rename the file named s1 to have the name s2."},"sortText":"2rename"},{"label":"repl","kind":3,"detail":"repl(s,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Concatenate i copies of string s."},"sortText":"2repl"},{"label":"reverse","kind":3,"detail":"reverse(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Reverse string s."},"sortText":"2reverse"},{"label":"right","kind":3,"detail":"right(s1,i,s2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Pad s1 on left with s2 to length i."},"sortText":"2right"},{"label":"rtod","kind":3,"detail":"rtod(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert r from radians to degrees."},"sortText":"2rtod"},{"label":"runerr","kind":3,"detail":"runerr(i,x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce runtime error i with value x."},"sortText":"2runerr"},{"label":"seek","kind":3,"detail":"seek(f,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Seek to offset i in file f. [[ What about seek error ? ]]"},"sortText":"2seek"},{"label":"seq","kind":3,"detail":"seq(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Generate i, i+j, i+2*j, ... ."},"sortText":"2seq"},{"label":"serial","kind":3,"detail":"serial(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Return serial number of structure."},"sortText":"2serial"},{"label":"set","kind":3,"detail":"set(L)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Create a set with members in list L. The members are linked into hash chains which are arranged in increasing order by hash number."},"sortText":"2set"},{"label":"sin","kind":3,"detail":"sin(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Sine of r, r in radians."},"sortText":"2sin"},{"label":"sort","kind":3,"detail":"sort(x,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Sort structure x by method i (for tables)"},"sortText":"2sort"},{"label":"sortf","kind":3,"detail":"sortf(x,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Sort list or set x on field i of each member"},"sortText":"2sortf"},{"label":"sqrt","kind":3,"detail":"sqrt(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Square root of r."},"sortText":"2sqrt"},{"label":"stop","kind":3,"detail":"stop(x1,x2,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Write the arguments and a newline to \u0026errout (or a file argument), then terminate the program with error status."},"sortText":"2stop"},{"label":"string","kind":3,"detail":"string(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a string, failing if that is not possible."},"sortText":"2string"},{"label":"system","kind":3,"detail":"system(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Execute string s as a system command."},"sortText":"2system"},{"label":"tab","kind":3,"detail":"tab(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Set \u0026pos to i, return substring of \u0026subject spanned. Reverses effects if resumed."},"sortText":"2tab"},{"label":"table","kind":3,"detail":"table(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Create a table with default value x."},"sortText":"2table"},{"label":"tan","kind":3,"detail":"tan(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Tangent of r, r in radians."},"sortText":"2tan"},{"label":"trim","kind":3,"detail":"trim(s,c)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Trim trailing characters in c from s."},"sortText":"2trim"},{"label":"type","kind":3,"detail":"type(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Return type of x as a string."},"sortText":"2type"},{"label":"uchar","kind":3,"detail":"uchar(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce the UTF-8 encoding of code point i"},"sortText":"2uchar"},{"label":"uord","kind":3,"detail":"uord(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce the code point of the one UTF-8 character s"},"sortText":"2uord"},{"label":"upto","kind":3,"detail":"upto(c,s,i1,i2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Generates the sequence of integer positions in s up to a character in c in s[i2:i2], but fails if there is no such position."},"sortText":"2upto"},{"label":"uset","kind":3,"detail":"uset(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a uset, failing if that is not possible"},"sortText":"2uset"},{"label":"uvalid","kind":3,"detail":"uvalid(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce s if it is valid UTF-8, else fail"},"sortText":"2uvalid"},{"label":"variable","kind":3,"detail":"variable(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Find the variable with name s and return a variable descriptor which points to its value."},"sortText":"2variable"},{"label":"where","kind":3,"detail":"where(f)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Return current offset position in file f."},"sortText":"2where"},{"label":"write","kind":3,"detail":"write(x1,x2,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Write the arguments followed by a newline; a file argument directs the following output to that file."},"sortText":"2write"},{"label":"writes","kind":3,"detail":"writes(x1,x2,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Write the arguments with no newline; a file argument directs the following output to that file."},"sortText":"2writes"},{"label":"break","kind":14,"sortText":"3break"},{"label":"by","kind":14,"sortText":"3by"},{"label":"case","kind":14,"sortText":"3case"},{"label":"create","kind":14,"sortText":"3create"},{"label":"default","kind":14,"sortText":"3default"},{"label":"do","kind":14,"sortText":"3do"},{"label":"else","kind":14,"sortText":"3else"},{"label":"end","kind":14,"sortText":"3end"},{"label":"every","kind":14,"sortText":"3every"},{"label":"fail","kind":14,"sortText":"3fail"},{"label":"global","kind":14,"sortText":"3global"},{"label":"if","kind":14,"sortText":"3if"},{"label":"initial","kind":14,"sortText":"3initial"},{"label":"invocable","kind":14,"sortText":"3invocable"},{"label":"link","kind":14,"sortText":"3link"},{"label":"local","kind":14,"sortText":"3local"},{"label":"next","kind":14,"sortText":"3next"},{"label":"not","kind":14,"sortText":"3not"},{"label":"of","kind":14,"sortText":"3of"},{"label":"procedure","kind":14,"sortText":"3procedure"},{"label":"record","kind":14,"sortText":"3record"},{"label":"repeat","kin